# Players dying, with violence_update on. A septon (9006, level 24, an area attacker) is put in the temple (3001),
# with Hassan, Smokegod (60, with wiznet's deaths and mob deaths on), Rambler (2, with 2088 experience: more than
# level 2's 2000, so dying costs some) and Pickpocket (13, in clan rom, with 30 gold and 200 silver), in Rambler's
# group. Rambler attacks and Pickpocket joins in: the septon's area attack hits both, and parries. Seraph is in the
# temple square (3005), to hear the death cries. The fight runs until someone is DEAD: Rambler, who is moved to the
# altar (3054, the hall for no clan), resting, and leaves a corpse only they can loot. Pickpocket is left stunned,
# out of the fight (with char_update off, nothing heals or kills them), so Smokegod forces the septon to kill them.
# Pickpocket, in a clan, leaves an unowned corpse with half their coins. Last, Smokegod slays the septon.
@updates area,violence
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
wiznet on
